{
  "info": {
    "name": "Internal Docker Registry API",
    "description": "查詢與刪除內網 Docker Registry 內的 image/tag。需先在 Postman 內設定 collection 變數 registry_host / username / password。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "basic",
    "basic": [
      { "key": "username", "value": "{{username}}", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "password", "value": "{{password}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "registry_host", "value": "registry.internal:5000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "username", "value": "EXAMPLE_ACCOUNT", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "EXAMPLE_PASSWORD", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "image_name", "value": "hello-app", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tag", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "digest", "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "由「Get Manifest Digest」的回應 header 複製貼上，供 Delete Manifest 使用" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. List Repositories (Catalog)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://{{registry_host}}/v2/_catalog",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["{{registry_host}}"],
          "path": ["v2", "_catalog"]
        },
        "description": "列出 Registry 內所有 repository（image 名稱）"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. List Tags for Image",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://{{registry_host}}/v2/{{image_name}}/tags/list",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["{{registry_host}}"],
          "path": ["v2", "{{image_name}}", "tags", "list"]
        },
        "description": "列出指定 image 的所有 tag（版本）"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Get Manifest (single-arch)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json, application/vnd.oci.image.manifest.v1+json" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://{{registry_host}}/v2/{{image_name}}/manifests/{{tag}}",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["{{registry_host}}"],
          "path": ["v2", "{{image_name}}", "manifests", "{{tag}}"]
        },
        "description": "查看單一架構 image 的 manifest 內容（layers、config 等）。若目標是 multi-arch image，這裡會回傳錯誤，請改用 #4。"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Get Manifest List / OCI Index (multi-arch)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json, application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://{{registry_host}}/v2/{{image_name}}/manifests/{{tag}}",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["{{registry_host}}"],
          "path": ["v2", "{{image_name}}", "manifests", "{{tag}}"]
        },
        "description": "查看 multi-arch image 的 manifest list（會列出 linux/amd64、linux/arm64 各自的 digest）。\n\nbuildx 建置的 image 預設為 OCI Index 格式（application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json），若用舊版 Docker manifest.list Accept header 會出現：\nMANIFEST_UNKNOWN: OCI index found, but accept header does not support OCI indexes\n\n此請求已同時帶入兩種格式的 Accept header 因應。"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Get Manifest Digest (for delete)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const digest = pm.response.headers.get('Docker-Content-Digest');",
              "if (digest) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('digest', digest);",
              "    console.log('取得 digest 並存入變數:', digest);",
              "} else {",
              "    console.warn('回應 header 找不到 Docker-Content-Digest，請確認 tag 是否存在');",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "HEAD",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json, application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json, application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json, application/vnd.oci.image.manifest.v1+json" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://{{registry_host}}/v2/{{image_name}}/manifests/{{tag}}",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["{{registry_host}}"],
          "path": ["v2", "{{image_name}}", "manifests", "{{tag}}"]
        },
        "description": "用 HEAD 取得該 tag 的 digest（回應 header 內的 Docker-Content-Digest），並自動存入 collection 變數 {{digest}}，供下一步刪除使用。\n\nAccept header 同時列出 OCI Index / Docker manifest list / 單一架構格式，因應 buildx 建置的 multi-arch image 預設為 OCI Index 格式，避免 MANIFEST_UNKNOWN 錯誤。\n\n⚠️ 若該 image 是 multi-arch，這裡拿到的是 index/manifest list 的 digest，刪除會連同所有平台版本一併移除。"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Delete Manifest (irreversible)",
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://{{registry_host}}/v2/{{image_name}}/manifests/{{digest}}",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["{{registry_host}}"],
          "path": ["v2", "{{image_name}}", "manifests", "{{digest}}"]
        },
        "description": "刪除 manifest（需先執行第 5 步取得 {{digest}}）。成功回傳 202 Accepted。\n\n⚠️ 此動作僅刪除 manifest 參照，實際磁碟空間需在 Registry 主機另外執行 garbage-collect 才會釋放：\n\ndocker compose exec registry bin/registry garbage-collect /etc/docker/registry/config.yml\n\n⚠️ 執行前請務必確認 tag/digest 正確，此動作無法復原。"
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ]
}